{
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "engine": "edge-tts",
  "rate": "+10%",
  "pitch": "-2Hz",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L01",
      "text": "农历八月十五，秋天刚好走到一半，所以叫中秋。",
      "rate": "+5%",
      "duration": 4.046,
      "start": 2.6,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz"
    },
    {
      "id": "L02",
      "text": "这一夜，月亮最圆，想念也最重。",
      "duration": 2.793,
      "start": 7.246,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L03",
      "text": "我是一块月饼，出生在外婆的厨房。",
      "duration": 2.684,
      "start": 14.239,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L04",
      "text": "揉面，包馅，再用外公刻的木模子，啪地一压——",
      "duration": 3.894,
      "start": 17.273,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L05",
      "text": "我的脸上，就印上了一个“圆”字。",
      "duration": 2.249,
      "start": 21.317,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L06",
      "text": "早在明朝，中秋送月饼就成了习俗，图的就是团圆。",
      "duration": 4.377,
      "start": 24.566,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L07",
      "text": "可今年，外婆的饭桌上，又空着一个位子。",
      "duration": 3.358,
      "start": 30.343,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L08",
      "text": "小满在很远的城市上班，已经三年没回家过中秋了。",
      "duration": 4.209,
      "start": 34.201,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L09",
      "text": "外婆把我装进盒子，压上一张字条，写好了地址。",
      "duration": 4.053,
      "start": 39.41,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L10",
      "text": "于是，我出发了。",
      "duration": 1.398,
      "start": 43.813,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L11",
      "text": "翻过山，跨过江，在夜车里摇摇晃晃。",
      "duration": 3.111,
      "start": 46.811,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L12",
      "text": "第一次离开外婆，我才知道，原来这就是想家。",
      "duration": 3.539,
      "start": 50.422,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L13",
      "text": "外婆讲过，月亮上住着嫦娥，她回不了家，就把月亮点得格外亮，好让地上想家的人，都看得见。",
      "duration": 7.667,
      "start": 54.861,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L14",
      "text": "半路上，一个盒子和我擦肩而过。它往南走，走得很急。",
      "duration": 4.769,
      "start": 63.328,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L15",
      "text": "终于，我到了小满的城市。楼很高，灯很亮，月亮却很远。",
      "duration": 5.064,
      "start": 69.397,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L16",
      "text": "她加完班回来，拆开盒子，看见了外婆的字：",
      "duration": 3.487,
      "start": 75.261,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L17",
      "text": "“月亮圆了，就算你回过家了。”",
      "rate": "+2%",
      "sub": false,
      "duration": 2.31,
      "start": 78.998,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz"
    },
    {
      "id": "L18",
      "text": "她咬了一口，是小时候的味道。眼睛，一下就红了。",
      "duration": 4.232,
      "start": 82.508,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L19",
      "text": "同一个晚上，外婆也收到了一个盒子。",
      "duration": 2.861,
      "start": 88.34,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L20",
      "text": "里面是一块歪歪扭扭的月饼，还有一张字条：“外婆，今年换我给你做。”",
      "duration": 5.352,
      "start": 91.651,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L21",
      "text": "原来，相思的“相”，是互相的相。",
      "rate": "+2%",
      "say": "原来，相思的香，是互相的香。",
      "duration": 2.784,
      "start": 98.403,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz"
    },
    {
      "id": "L22",
      "text": "九百多年前的中秋，苏轼想念弟弟，写下了一句：",
      "duration": 3.903,
      "start": 102.787,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L23",
      "text": "但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。",
      "rate": "-12%",
      "sub": false,
      "duration": 2.726,
      "start": 107.04,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz"
    },
    {
      "id": "L24",
      "text": "隔着千里，我们看的，是同一个月亮。",
      "duration": 2.935,
      "start": 111.766,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "rate": "+10%"
    },
    {
      "id": "L25",
      "text": "中秋快乐。",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "duration": 1.069,
      "start": 115.701,
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "default_rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz"
    }
  ]
}
